 the entire document. This attribute group is not used for a required id attribute, or for an id attribute that specifies an id reference."}]}],"name":"id"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The value of this element."}]}],"name":"value"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether the fermata is upright or inverted. Upright if not specified."}]}],"name":"kind"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For most elements, any program will compute a default x and y position. The position attributes let this be changed two ways."}]}],"name":"position"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The font attribute group gathers together attributes for determining the font within a credit or direction. They are based on the text styles for Cascading Style Sheets. The font-family is a comma-separated list of font names.The font-style can be normal or italic. The font-size can be one of the CSS sizes or a numeric point size. The font-weight can be normal or bold. The default is application-dependent, but is a text font vs. a music font."}]}],"name":"font"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The color attribute group indicates the color of an element."}]}],"name":"color"}],"kind":"parameters"}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLFermata/Shape":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlfermata\/shape","title":"MXLFermata.Shape","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Shape","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Shape","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The fermata-shape type represents the shape of the fermata sign. The empty value is equivalent to the normal"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\